{"seq":3,"slug":"reel-in-out","title":"卷收与放绳：让绳长成为一个可玩的旋钮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-grappling-hook/rope/reel-in-out","wordCount":1489,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"卷收与放绳-让绳长成为一个可玩的旋钮\">卷收与放绳：让绳长成为一个可玩的旋钮</h1><p>到目前为止绳长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是个常数：钩住时定下、之后不变。但真正好玩的抓钩会把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 变成玩家能主动操作的量——按住一个键把自己往锚点收（拉近、爬升、加速），松绳则放长（下坠、拉开距离）。改变绳长不只是换个数字，它在物理上等价于向摆荡系统注入或抽取能量，用得好能让玩家「泵」出越荡越高的轨迹。这一篇讲卷收放绳的三种模型、它与摆荡的能量耦合、以及附着期间的空中操控。它建立在前两篇的约束与摆荡之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-改变绳长就是改变约束\">核心概念：改变绳长就是改变约束</h2><p>前两篇的约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lVert\\vec{p}-\\vec{a}\\rVert\\le L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 一直是常数。卷收放绳就是让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 随输入变化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">clamp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>input</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{t+1} = \\operatorname{clamp}\\big(L_t + r \\cdot \\text{input} \\cdot \\Delta t,\\; L_{\\min},\\; L_{\\max}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">input</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是卷收速率、input 为正收绳负放绳。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 防止玩家把自己收到锚点里穿模，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 限制最大绳长（常等于钩爪射程）。看似只改一个标量，但它牵动整个约束求解：绳缩短时，如果玩家当前距离已大于新 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，约束会立刻把玩家往锚点拉——这一拉就是能量注入的来源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[玩家按住收绳键] --&gt; B[L 减小]&#10;  B --&gt; C{当前距离 d &gt; 新 L?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[约束把玩家拉向锚点&lt;br/&gt;产生向心位移]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[绳仍松弛,无即时效果]&#10;  D --&gt; F{在摆荡的哪个相位收?}&#10;  F --&gt;|低点附近收| G[高效注入能量&lt;br/&gt;越荡越高]&#10;  F --&gt;|高点附近收| H[效率低,近乎纯拉近]\">graph TD\n  A[玩家按住收绳键] --&gt; B[L 减小]\n  B --&gt; C{当前距离 d &gt; 新 L?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[约束把玩家拉向锚点&lt;br/&gt;产生向心位移]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[绳仍松弛,无即时效果]\n  D --&gt; F{在摆荡的哪个相位收?}\n  F --&gt;|低点附近收| G[高效注入能量&lt;br/&gt;越荡越高]\n  F --&gt;|高点附近收| H[效率低,近乎纯拉近]</pre><h2 id=\"三种卷收模型\">三种卷收模型</h2><p>「怎么收」有三种典型手感，对应不同游戏气质：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>手感</th>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>绞盘式（硬收）</td>\n<td>按恒定速率减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，约束硬拉</td>\n<td>干脆、有力、可控</td>\n<td>太快像瞬移，失去摆荡</td>\n<td>Just Cause 拉钩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弹簧式（软收）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是弹簧静止长度，靠弹力慢慢收</td>\n<td>有弹性、有回弹、柔和</td>\n<td>太软控制迟钝，太硬抖动</td>\n<td>Unity SpringJoint 原型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泵动式（相位收）</td>\n<td>只在低点附近允许高效收绳</td>\n<td>需要技巧、越荡越高</td>\n<td>学习曲线陡</td>\n<td>强调技巧的平台游戏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>绞盘式最直接：<code>ropeLength -= reelSpeed * dt</code>，然后跑约束把玩家拉过去。它把摆荡压扁成拉近，适合「我就是要快速上去」的场景。弹簧式借引擎的 SpringJoint（把静止长度往下调，弹力自然收玩家），手感更肉、更有机，但参数难调——刚度太低控制迟钝，太高绳会高频抖动（见 <a href=\"rope-constraint\">1_rope-constraint.md</a> 里弹簧关节的同一权衡）。泵动式是给硬核玩家的：把「收绳只在低点高效」做成显式规则，让玩家学会踩节奏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"能量耦合-为什么低点收绳能越荡越高\">能量耦合：为什么低点收绳能越荡越高</h2><p>这是卷收最深的一层，也是它和摆荡（<a href=\"swing-physics\">2_swing-physics.md</a>）真正咬合的地方。缩短绳长是<strong>对系统做功</strong>：约束沿绳把玩家往锚点拉，如果玩家此刻有垂直于绳的运动（即在摆荡），这个向心的拉力会……不做功（垂直于速度的力不做功）。真正注入能量的机制更微妙——它来自角动量。</p>\n<p>在低点，玩家绕锚点的角速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span></span></span></span> 与绳长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 满足近似的角动量关系。缩短 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 会让切向速度上升（如同花样滑冰收臂加速），从而抬高整条摆荡轨迹能达到的高度。定性结论对做游戏足够：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>在低点（速度大、方向近水平）收绳</strong>：高效抬升摆荡，玩家「泵」得起来。</li>\n<li><strong>在高点（速度小、绳近竖直）收绳</strong>：几乎就是纯粹把自己拉近锚点，不增幅摆荡。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所以「越荡越高」不是随便按收绳键，而是<strong>在低点收、在高点放</strong>——这恰好是真实秋千泵动的节奏。把这个机制暴露给玩家（哪怕不解释原理），就创造了一个可精通的技巧层，直接喂养「掌控感」维度。手感如何引导玩家发现这个节奏，见 <a href=\"../practice/grapple-feel\">4_practice/1_grapple-feel.md</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"附着期间的空中操控与放绳\">附着期间的空中操控与放绳</h2><p>卷收之外，附着期间玩家通常还能做别的：左右微调（切向输入，见摆荡篇的能量注入）、主动放绳下坠、以及为了衔接下一次抓钩而调整姿态。设计上要决定这些操作的权限边界：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[Attached 附着中] --&gt; B[收绳键: L 减,拉近/爬升]&#10;  A --&gt; C[放绳键: L 增,下坠/拉开]&#10;  A --&gt; D[方向输入: 切向小推力,微调弧线]&#10;  A --&gt; E[跳跃/松手键: 进入 Detached,保留动量]&#10;  B --&gt; F{L 到 L_min?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[到达锚点,可自动脱离或悬挂]&#10;  C --&gt; H{L 到 L_max?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[绳满,不再放长]\">flowchart TD\n  A[Attached 附着中] --&gt; B[收绳键: L 减,拉近/爬升]\n  A --&gt; C[放绳键: L 增,下坠/拉开]\n  A --&gt; D[方向输入: 切向小推力,微调弧线]\n  A --&gt; E[跳跃/松手键: 进入 Detached,保留动量]\n  B --&gt; F{L 到 L_min?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[到达锚点,可自动脱离或悬挂]\n  C --&gt; H{L 到 L_max?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[绳满,不再放长]</pre><p>一个常被忽略的细节：<strong>放绳到底</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）和<strong>收绳到底</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）都要有明确的行为定义。收到底时，玩家是自动脱离（适合「拉上去就结束」的位移工具）还是悬挂在锚点下（适合「挂着观察/瞄准」的场景）？放到底时绳是绷直不再变（自然）还是断裂（惩罚玩家钩太远）？这些边界决策会渗进关卡设计与失败模式，统一在 <a href=\"../practice/grappling-in-practice\">4_practice/3_grappling-in-practice.md</a> 收口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>卷收放绳就是让约束里的<strong>绳长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 随输入变化</strong>，配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 防穿模与限射程；改 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 会立刻牵动约束求解。</li>\n<li>三种模型：<strong>绞盘式</strong>干脆可控、<strong>弹簧式</strong>柔和难调、<strong>泵动式</strong>技巧向；分别对应不同游戏气质。</li>\n<li><strong>能量耦合</strong>是精髓：在低点收绳（切向速度大）能高效抬升摆荡、越荡越高，高点收绳只是纯拉近——这创造了可精通的技巧层。</li>\n<li>附着期间的收/放/微调/松手构成操控矩阵，<strong>收到底与放到底的边界行为</strong>必须明确定义，否则会渗成失败模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"swing-physics\">摆荡物理</a>——卷收注入的能量在摆荡系统里如何体现。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"rope-constraint\">绳索约束</a>——绳长是其约束不等式里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../practice/grappling-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>——收/放到底的边界行为与失败模式。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-physics/rigid-body-dynamics/constraint-systems\">物理 · 约束系统</a>——可变长度约束的一般处理。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../gameplay-ability-systems/effects-tags/cooldowns-costs\">能力系统 · 冷却与消耗</a>——把收绳做成有消耗的能力资源。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：SpringJoint 收绳做法综合自 Unity Discussions 抓钩/弹簧关节讨论（answers.unity.com, discussions.unity.com）；角动量与泵动的能量注入为经典力学，定性结论面向游戏实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"卷收与放绳：让绳长成为一个可玩的旋钮","id":"卷收与放绳-让绳长成为一个可玩的旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：改变绳长就是改变约束","id":"核心概念-改变绳长就是改变约束"},{"level":2,"text":"三种卷收模型","id":"三种卷收模型"},{"level":2,"text":"能量耦合：为什么低点收绳能越荡越高","id":"能量耦合-为什么低点收绳能越荡越高"},{"level":2,"text":"附着期间的空中操控与放绳","id":"附着期间的空中操控与放绳"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"摆荡物理：单摆、能量与那一下「甩出去」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-grappling-hook/rope/swing-physics"},"next":{"title":"手感与辅助：在玩家意图与物理真实之间调停","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-grappling-hook/practice/grapple-feel"}}